{
  "title": "ATLAS Open Data ADL Analysis Suite",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "<p>A software package for running and validating nine analyses of the ATLAS Open Data C++ framework, implemented in ADL and run with the CutLang runtime interpreter. It provides input dataset information, sample configurations, scripts to run the analyses, normalize and merge the outputs, plot the results and compare cutflows with the ATLAS Open Data framework.</p>",
